# large files: .gitignore cannot select files by size. data/raw/ holds only
# downloads, so everything in it is ignored except these two files:
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/MANIFEST.csv
# data/input/ cannot be covered by a size rule. before `git add`, run:
#   find data -type f -size +25000k

